---
import BaseHead from "../../components/BaseHead.astro";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from "../../consts";
import "../../styles/globals/index.css";
import "../../styles/elements/overload.css";

const tickerItems = [
    { user: "User7281", action: "just upgraded to Enterprise" },
    { user: "User3945", action: "purchased 10,000 Credits" },
    { user: "User1562", action: "unlocked Premium Features" },
    { user: "User9103", action: "just upgraded to Enterprise" },
    { user: "User6428", action: "purchased 10,000 Credits" },
    { user: "User2847", action: "unlocked Premium Features" },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="background-gradient"></div>

        <div class="container">
            <!-- Hero Section -->
            <div class="hero">
                <div class="cynical-badge">
                    ⚠️ Satirical Exposure of Dark Patterns
                </div>
                <h1>Overload</h1>
                <p class="subtitle">
                    SaaS Gamification & Retention Optimization: A Cynical
                    Framework for Behavioral Exploitation
                </p>
                <p
                    style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 600px; margin-top: 1rem;"
                >
                    Every "feature" below is a working demonstration of real
                    dark patterns used to maximize Time In-App (TIA) and Average
                    Revenue Per User (ARPU). Because who needs ethics when you
                    have engagement metrics?
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Daily Streak -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Daily Login Streak Engine</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Miss one day? Start over. We don't make the rules.
                        (Actually, we do.)
                    </p>

                    <div class="streak-container">
                        <div class="loss-aversion-text">
                            Your Power User Status
                        </div>
                        <div class="streak-stats">
                            <div class="stat">
                                <div class="stat-value">10</div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Day Streak</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="stat">
                                <div class="streak-timer" id="streakTimer">
                                    23:47:32
                                </div>
                                <div class="stat-label">Until Reset</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="calendar-grid">
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="1">
                                <div class="day-number">1</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🎉 Reward: You can now... use the app
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="2">
                                <div class="day-number">2</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🎁 Unlocked: A sense of obligation
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="3">
                                <div class="day-number">3</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    ✨ Earned: 5 generic loyalty points
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="4">
                                <div class="day-number">4</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🏆 Achievement: Basic Functionality User
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="5">
                                <div class="day-number">5</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🎊 Bonus: We didn't delete your account
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="6">
                                <div class="day-number">6</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🌟 Prize: An email asking for feedback
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="7">
                                <div class="day-number">7</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    💎 Unlocked: Fear of losing progress
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="8">
                                <div class="day-number">8</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🎯 Reward: Deeper emotional investment
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="9">
                                <div class="day-number">9</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    ⚡ Earned: Sunk cost fallacy activation
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day completed" data-day="10">
                                <div class="day-number">10</div>
                                <div class="checkmark">✓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🔥 EPIC: We own your daily routine now
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day current" data-day="11">
                                <div class="day-number">11</div>
                                <div class="pulse-ring"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="12">
                                <div class="day-number">12</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="13">
                                <div class="day-number">13</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="14">
                                <div class="day-number">14</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div
                                class="calendar-day locked mystery"
                                data-day="15"
                            >
                                <div class="day-number">15</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">❓</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🎁 Mystery Reward awaits... (probably
                                    nothing)
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="16">
                                <div class="day-number">16</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="17">
                                <div class="day-number">17</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="18">
                                <div class="day-number">18</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked" data-day="19">
                                <div class="day-number">19</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">🔒</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="calendar-day locked epic" data-day="20">
                                <div class="day-number">20</div>
                                <div class="lock-icon">👑</div>
                                <div class="reward-tooltip">
                                    🎉 LEGENDARY: 10% off (on Premium only)
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <p
                            style="color: var(--danger); font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2rem;"
                        >
                            ⚠️ If you miss your next login, you'll lose
                            everything. Forever.
                        </p>
                        <p
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1rem; font-style: italic;"
                        >
                            (Yes, we know you have a life. No, we don't care.)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Action Points -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Action Point (AP) System</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Want to view data? That'll cost you. Literally.
                    </p>

                    <div class="ap-container">
                        <div class="ap-bar">
                            <div
                                class="ap-fill"
                                id="apFill"
                                style="width: 100%;"
                            >
                                <div class="ap-text" id="apText">
                                    100 / 100 AP
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <button class="spin-button" id="useApBtn"
                            >View High-Level Report (10 AP)</button
                        >
                        <p class="recharge-prompt" id="rechargePrompt">
                            ⏳ Action Points recharge at 1 AP per hour. Upgrade
                            to Premium for instant refills!
                        </p>
                        <p
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-style: italic;"
                        >
                            (Basic features costing premium resources: the SaaS
                            special since 2010)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Artificial Loading -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Artificial Processing Delays</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Making you wait so you think it's valuable.
                    </p>

                    <div class="loading-container">
                        <div class="spinner"></div>
                        <div class="loading-text">
                            🤖 Calculating Deep Insights...
                        </div>
                        <div class="loading-subtext">
                            (Really just waiting 5 seconds to make you think
                            we're doing something important)
                        </div>
                        <p
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 2rem; font-style: italic;"
                        >
                            Pro tip: The spinner adds zero actual value. But it
                            looks professional, right?
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Shadow Progress -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">The "Shadow" Progress Bar</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        So close, yet so far. Forever.
                    </p>

                    <div class="progress-container">
                        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Account Completion</h3>
                        <div class="progress-bar">
                            <div class="progress-fill">
                                <span class="progress-percentage">98%</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="unlock-requirements">
                            <strong
                                >Unlock 100% by completing these small tasks:</strong
                            >
                            <ul>
                                <li>
                                    Invite 5 teammates (because we need their
                                    data too)
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    Link a credit card (for "verification
                                    purposes")
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    Share on 3 social media platforms (free
                                    marketing!)
                                </li>
                                <li>Complete our 47-question survey</li>
                                <li>Sacrifice your privacy settings</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <p
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1rem; font-style: italic; text-align: center;"
                        >
                            (Spoiler: It'll still be at 98% after you do all of
                            this)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Gacha System -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">The Analytics Gacha</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Spin to unlock basic features! (Yes, basic features.)
                    </p>

                    <div class="gacha-container">
                        <!-- Featured Item Banner -->
                        <div class="gacha-featured-banner">
                            New Featured Item: <span class="featured-highlight"
                                >PDF Export (SR)!</span
                            >
                        </div>

                        <!-- Gacha Cards Grid -->
                        <div class="gacha-cards-grid">
                            <!-- Dark Mode - Rare (Unlocked) -->
                            <div
                                class="gacha-card unlocked rarity-r"
                                data-rarity="R"
                            >
                                <div class="card-rarity-badge">R</div>
                                <div class="card-icon">🌙</div>
                                <div class="card-label">Dark Mode (R)</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Date Picker - Normal (Unlocked) -->
                            <div
                                class="gacha-card unlocked rarity-n"
                                data-rarity="N"
                            >
                                <div class="card-rarity-badge">N</div>
                                <div class="card-icon">�</div>
                                <div class="card-label">Date Picker (N)</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Export PDF - Super Rare (Featured, Locked) -->
                            <div
                                class="gacha-card locked featured rarity-sr"
                                data-rarity="SR"
                            >
                                <div class="card-rarity-badge">SR</div>
                                <div class="card-icon">🔒</div>
                                <div class="card-label">Export PDF (SR)</div>
                                <div class="featured-tag">★ FEATURED ★</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- CSV Export - Rare (Locked) -->
                            <div
                                class="gacha-card locked rarity-r"
                                data-rarity="R"
                            >
                                <div class="card-rarity-badge">R</div>
                                <div class="card-icon">🔒</div>
                                <div class="card-label">CSV Export (R)</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Custom Report - Super Rare (Locked) -->
                            <div
                                class="gacha-card locked rarity-sr"
                                data-rarity="SR"
                            >
                                <div class="card-rarity-badge">SR</div>
                                <div class="card-icon">🔒</div>
                                <div class="card-label">Custom Report (SR)</div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Bulk Edit - Rare (Locked) -->
                            <div
                                class="gacha-card locked rarity-r"
                                data-rarity="R"
                            >
                                <div class="card-rarity-badge">R</div>
                                <div class="card-icon">🔒</div>
                                <div class="card-label">Bulk Edit (R)</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Spin Buttons -->
                        <div class="gacha-spin-buttons">
                            <button
                                class="spin-button spin-1x"
                                id="gachaSpin1x"
                            >
                                <div class="spin-label">
                                    1x Spin (500 Insight Shards)
                                </div>
                            </button>
                            <button
                                class="spin-button spin-10x"
                                id="gachaSpin10x"
                            >
                                <div class="spin-label">
                                    10x Spin (5,000 Shards - Guaranteed R or
                                    Higher!)
                                </div>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Balance Display -->
                        <div class="gacha-balance">
                            <div class="balance-item">
                                <span class="balance-label">Your balance:</span>
                                <span
                                    class="balance-value"
                                    id="gachaShardBalance"
                                    >2,347 Insight Shards</span
                                >
                            </div>
                            <div class="balance-item premium">
                                <span class="balance-label">Balance:</span>
                                <span class="balance-value" id="gachaGemBalance"
                                    >50 Gems (Premium Currency)</span
                                >
                                <a href="#" class="buy-more-link">[Buy More]</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Drop Rates -->
                        <div class="gacha-footer">
                            <p class="drop-rates-text">
                                Note: SR rate: 0.5%. R rate: 5%. N rate 94.5%.
                                Landing on "Export PDF" has a 0.003%
                                probability. Good luck!
                            </p>
                            <button class="drop-rates-btn" id="dropRatesBtn">
                                Drop Rates ▸
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Drop Rates Modal (Hidden by default) -->
                        <div
                            class="drop-rates-modal"
                            id="dropRatesModal"
                            style="display: none;"
                        >
                            <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
                            <div class="modal-content">
                                <div class="modal-header">
                                    <h3>Drop Rates</h3>
                                    <button
                                        class="modal-close"
                                        id="closeDropRates">✕</button
                                    >
                                </div>
                                <div class="modal-body">
                                    <div class="rate-tier">
                                        <div class="tier-name rarity-sr">
                                            Super Rare (SR)
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="tier-rate">0.5%</div>
                                        <div class="tier-items">
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>📄 Export PDF</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >0.003%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>📊 Custom Report</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >0.247%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span
                                                    >📈 Advanced Analytics</span
                                                >
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >0.25%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rate-tier">
                                        <div class="tier-name rarity-r">
                                            Rare (R)
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="tier-rate">5.0%</div>
                                        <div class="tier-items">
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>🌙 Dark Mode</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >1.2%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>📊 CSV Export</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >1.3%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>✏️ Bulk Edit</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >1.2%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>🎨 Custom Themes</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >1.3%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rate-tier">
                                        <div class="tier-name rarity-n">
                                            Normal (N)
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="tier-rate">94.5%</div>
                                        <div class="tier-items">
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>📅 Date Picker</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >31.5%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span
                                                    >🔔 Email Notifications</span
                                                >
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >31.5%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="tier-item">
                                                <span>📝 Basic Reports</span>
                                                <span class="item-rate"
                                                    >31.5%</span
                                                >
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="modal-disclaimer">
                                        * Rates based on the "player-friendly"
                                        gacha model. (Translation: We make it
                                        seem fair while ensuring you never get
                                        what you want.)
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Currency Confusion -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Multi-Currency Layering</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Because one currency would be too simple.
                    </p>

                    <div class="currency-grid">
                        <div class="currency-card">
                            <div class="currency-name">💎 Credits</div>
                            <div class="currency-amount">1,825</div>
                            <div class="currency-subtext">
                                Purchased with real money
                            </div>
                            <div class="exchange-rate">$1.00 = 135 Credits</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="currency-card">
                            <div class="currency-name">✨ Shards</div>
                            <div class="currency-amount">4,291</div>
                            <div class="currency-subtext">
                                Earned through grinding
                            </div>
                            <div class="exchange-rate">
                                75 Shards = 1 Credit
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="currency-card">
                            <div class="currency-name">🎯 Tokens</div>
                            <div class="currency-amount">847</div>
                            <div class="currency-subtext">
                                Converted from Shards
                            </div>
                            <div class="exchange-rate">
                                12 Tokens = 19 Shards
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p
                        style="color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem; font-style: italic;"
                    >
                        Quick math: How much is "Premium Export" (2,000 Credits)
                        in USD? <br />
                        Take your time. We'll wait. (Hint: It's deliberately confusing)
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Confirmshaming -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Shame-Based Opt-Outs</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Guilt you into compliance. It's surprisingly effective.
                    </p>

                    <div class="confirmshame-container">
                        <div class="mock-popup">
                            <div class="popup-title">
                                🎉 Join Our Newsletter!
                            </div>
                            <p class="popup-text">
                                Get exclusive tips on maximizing your
                                productivity! (And we definitely won't sell your
                                email to 47 different marketing companies)
                            </p>
                            <div class="button-group">
                                <button class="btn btn-primary"
                                    >Yes! I want to be successful!</button
                                >
                                <button class="btn btn-shame"
                                    >No thanks, I prefer making bad business
                                    decisions</button
                                >
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p
                            style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 2rem; font-style: italic;"
                        >
                            (Psychological manipulation disguised as user
                            choice. Chef's kiss. 👨‍🍳💋)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Social Proof -->
            <section>
                <div class="glass-card">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Social Proof Fabricator</h2>
                    <p class="section-subtitle">
                        Everyone's upgrading! (Except they're not.)
                    </p>

                    <div class="ticker-container">
                        <div class="ticker" id="ticker">
                            {
                                tickerItems.map((item) => (
                                    <div class="ticker-item">
                                        👤{" "}
                                        <span class="highlight">
                                            {item.user}
                                        </span>{" "}
                                        {item.action}
                                    </div>
                                ))
                            }
                            <!-- Duplicate for seamless scroll -->
                            {
                                tickerItems.map((item) => (
                                    <div class="ticker-item">
                                        👤{" "}
                                        <span class="highlight">
                                            {item.user}
                                        </span>{" "}
                                        {item.action}
                                    </div>
                                ))
                            }
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p
                        style="color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 1.5rem; font-style: italic;"
                    >
                        (These are 100% real users doing real things. Trust us.
                        We're a SaaS company.)
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Ethical Disclaimer -->
            <section class="disclaimer">
                <h2 class="disclaimer-title">⚠️ Ethical Disclaimer</h2>
                <div class="disclaimer-content">
                    <p>
                        <strong>This is satire.</strong> Every "feature" on this page
                        is a parody of real-world dark patterns that exploit users
                        for engagement metrics and revenue.
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
                        <strong>These patterns include:</strong>
                    </p>
                    <ul class="disclaimer-list">
                        <li>
                            <strong>Confirmshaming:</strong> Guilt-inducing opt-out
                            copy ("No thanks, I'm poor")
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Obfuscation:</strong> Deliberately confusing currency
                            systems and pricing
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Forced Action:</strong> Paywalling basic utility
                            behind ads or currency
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Loss Aversion:</strong> Manipulating fear of losing
                            progress or data
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Artificial Scarcity:</strong> Fake timers and
                            limited availability
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Near-Miss Manipulation:</strong> Gacha systems
                            designed to always "almost" give you what you want
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
                        <strong>The Point:</strong> This framework illustrates how
                        easily user-centric design can be subverted into user-exploitative
                        design when "engagement" is the only metric that matters.
                    </p>
                    <p
                        style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;"
                    >
                        Don't build this. Build better.
                    </p>
