                            🎉 Join thousands of satisfied users receiving our
                            daily emails!
                        </p>

                        <div
                            style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-center; flex-wrap: wrap;"
                        >
                            <button class="spin-button">
                                Subscribe to More Emails!
                            </button>
                            <button
                                class="spin-button"
                                style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-primary), var(--accent-secondary));"
                            >
                                Enable All Notifications!
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- The "hidden" unsubscribe -->
                        <div
                            style="margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center; opacity: 0.15; transition: opacity 0.3s;"
                        >
                            <p
                                style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #333; letter-spacing: -0.5px; line-height: 1.1;"
                            >
                                If you no longer wish to receive our absolutely
                                essential daily emails about features you'll
                                never use, limited-time offers that aren't
                                actually limited, and urgent notifications about
                                things that aren't urgent, you may,
                                theoretically, after completing a brief 47-step
                                verification process, potentially consider the
                                possibility of maybe adjusting your
                                communication preferences by locating and
                                successfully navigating to the preferences
                                panel, which may or may not be accessible
                                depending on your current subscription tier and
                                whether Mercury is in retrograde.
                                <br />
                                <span style="color: var(--text-muted);">
                                    To unsubscribe, simply don't click
                                    <a
                                        href="#"
                                        style="text-decoration: none; cursor: default; pointer-events: none;"
                                    >
                                        here
                                    </a>
                                    but instead click
                                </span>
                                <a
                                    href="#"
                                    id="actualUnsubscribe"
                                    style="text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.8px; color: var(--text-muted);"
                                    >here</a
                                >
                                <span style="">
                                    or maybe
                                    <a
                                        href="#"
                                        style="text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-muted);"
                                    >
                                        this one
                                    </a>
                                    to begin the unsubscription consideration request
